# Origin of the Laravel API, no trailing slash.
#
# Leave this blank in production: Laravel serves both the API and this SPA from
# one origin, so relative paths are correct and there is no CORS to configure.
#
# Set it only when running `npm run dev` against a Laravel instance on another
# port. Doing so makes requests cross-origin, so that instance must allow this
# origin with credentials for the session cookie to survive.
VITE_API_URL=
